# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出也用 LF
# 原因：public/futuremirror-demo.html 的「逐字节重建」验证依赖原始字节不被改写，
# Windows 默认 autocrlf 会把 LF 转成 CRLF，破坏 scripts/build-demo.js 的等价性证明。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
